              Guru Nanak Institutions Technical Campus (GNITC), Hyderabad was
              established in <strong>2001</strong>
              under the Guru Nanak Educational Society. The institution has
              earned recognition as one of the leading autonomous engineering
              colleges in Telangana, offering quality education in Engineering,
              Management and Pharmacy.
            </p>

            <p>
              GNITC is affiliated with
              <strong
