              autonomous status, providing students with industry-oriented
              curriculum, modern laboratories and experienced faculty.
            </p>

            <p>
              The institution focuses on innovation, research, entrepreneurship
              and holistic student development, creating graduates who are
              technically competent, socially responsible and industry ready.
            </p>
